{"id":"n26807-2-8","stage":5,"title":"거리낌 · 顾忌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26807-2-8-1","ko":"너 길에서 주운 돈 십만 원을 경찰서에 갖다 줬다며?","zh":"你把在街上捡到的十万韩元交到警察局去了，对吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길에서","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주운","meaning":"捡，拾","explanation":"줍다：捡，拾；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"줍다","audio":"/audio/d734298af378155884a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82140","senseId":"1","lemma":"줍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"십만","meaning":"十万","explanation":"십만：十万","readings":[{"term":"십만","audio":"/audio/7d6f8073f178183cea8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93501","senseId":"1","lemma":"십만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"원을","meaning":"韩元，韩币","explanation":"원：韩元，韩币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"원","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27771","senseId":"1","lemma":"원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경찰서에","meaning":"警察署，警察局，公安局","explanation":"경찰서：警察署，警察局，公安局；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"경찰서","audio":"/audio/d7c352449c7960ec1ec2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25960","senseId":"1","lemma":"경찰서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갖다","meaning":"持，带，戴","explanation":"갖다：持，带，戴；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"갖다","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29738","senseId":"1","lemma":"갖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줬다며?","meaning":"给予，给","explanation":"주다：给予，给；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82136","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"d734298af3781558","term":"줍다","zh":"捡，拾","audio":"/audio/d734298af378155884a3.mp3","entryId":"82140","definition":"拿起掉在地上或散开的东西。","pronunciation":["줍ː따"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"7d6f8073f178183c","term":"십만","zh":"十万","audio":"/audio/7d6f8073f178183cea8e.mp3","entryId":"93501","definition":"万的十倍的数目。","pronunciation":["심만"]},{"id":"c19fd6787279897c","term":"원","zh":"韩元，韩币","audio":"/audio/c19fd6787279897c79a8.mp3","entryId":"27771","definition":"韩国货币单位。","pronunciation":["원"]},{"id":"d7c352449c7960ec","term":"경찰서","zh":"警察署，警察局，公安局","audio":"/audio/d7c352449c7960ec1ec2.mp3","entryId":"25960","definition":"负责一个地区的公安工作的官厅。","pronunciation":["경ː찰써"]},{"id":"48e4cf165dc4c1c6","term":"갖다","zh":"持，带，戴","audio":"/audio/48e4cf165dc4c1c6d001.mp3","entryId":"29738","definition":"手里握着或身上携带着某物。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"给予，给","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"82136","definition":"把东西等递给别人，让别人拥有或使用。","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2cebb01404eca30e3f40.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26807-2-8-2","ko":"응. 내가 가지려니 거리낌이 느껴져서.","zh":"嗯。因为觉得留着它不太合适，所以就交出去了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가지려니","meaning":"拥有，得到；表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"가지다：拥有，得到；하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"},{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"2","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거리낌이","meaning":"顾忌，忌惮","explanation":"거리낌：顾忌，忌惮；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"거리낌","audio":"/audio/386e5bc33398f2798eb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26807","senseId":"2","lemma":"거리낌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느껴져서.","meaning":"感受，觉得，感到；表示成为前面表达的那样。","explanation":"느끼다：感受，觉得，感到；지다：表示成为前面表达的那样。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"2","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"2","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"拥有，得到","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"占为己有。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"386e5bc33398f279","term":"거리낌","zh":"顾忌，忌惮","audio":"/audio/386e5bc33398f2798eb7.mp3","entryId":"26807","definition":"觉得某事别扭忌讳。","pronunciation":["거리낌"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"内心经历某种情感。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的那样。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/797a44d897d52d44075c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.353,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26807","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1797,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。因为觉得留着它不太合适，所以就交出去了。","你不是说同时做两份兼职吗？应该能赚很多钱吧？","你把在街上捡到的十万韩元交到警察局去了，对吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。因为觉得留着它不太合适，所以就交出去了。","你把在街上捡到的十万韩元交到警察局去了，对吧？","你不是说同时做两份兼职吗？应该能赚很多钱吧？"],"answer":0}]}
